---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — Brandon Nguyen"
  description="Neuroscience student at UVA. Writing about the brain, medicine, and things in between."
>
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1 class="about-title">About</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose about-prose">
      <p>
        I'm Brandon Nguyen, a neuroscience student at the University of Virginia on the pre-med track.
        I grew up thinking science and writing were separate languages. They're not — they just share an
        uneasy border, and I'm interested in what lives there.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is where I write. Essays tend toward the analytical: how the brain makes predictions,
        what fMRI can and can't tell us, why medicine is as much a humanistic discipline as a technical one.
        Poetry is something else entirely — shorter, less interested in argument, more interested in what
        can't be said directly.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm also a builder. I make things when making helps me understand something, which is most of the time.
      </p>

      <p>
        If something here is worth talking about, you can find me at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:qweelut1@gmail.com">qweelut1@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-wrap {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) 8rem;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-prose {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
</style>
